          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 14 2024 17:16:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>46% of hospitalized incontinent patients</b> had IAD in a study published in the Journal of Wound, Ostomy and Continence Nursing<sup>6</sup></span></p>\n",
