      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "3",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 14 2024 17:11:02 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #545857;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #af6d04;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Help reduce IAD with cloths</span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage Comfort Shield Barrier Cream Cloths with dimethicone can help you provide consistent patient care by applying an effective barrier every time. Each cloth delivers all-in-one skin cleansing, moisturizing, deodorizing, treatment and barrier protection.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Dimethicone formula helps treat and prevent IAD; helps seal out wetness&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Breathable, transparent dimethicone barrier makes skin assessment easy&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Allows the use of other products such as antifungals without removing </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Dimethicone barrier<sup>7&nbsp;</sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Hypoallergenic, gentle and non-irritating</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">3-pack (smaller cloth size):<b> Reorder #7502</b></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">3-pack:<b> Reorder #7503</b></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">8-pack:<b> Reorder #7905</b></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">24-pack:<b> Reorder #7924</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Apr 01 2024 17:10:48 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
